I will.

00:16:25.148 --> 00:16:27.248
You're out of items, right?

00:16:27.318 --> 00:16:28.188
Give it up.

00:16:33.328 --> 00:16:35.128
If I give up...

00:16:35.598 --> 00:16:38.688
...I can't go...

00:16:39.368 --> 00:16:40.768
...back to them.

00:16:41.168 --> 00:16:43.998
Are your friends
that important to you?

00:16:44.638 --> 00:16:47.038
Don't get all serious over a game

00:16:48.238 --> 00:16:51.138
It doesn't matter
where you meet someone.

00:16:51.808 --> 00:16:53.508
A friend is a friend.

00:16:58.918 --> 00:17:01.648
Even though I can't
see their faces...

00:17:03.688 --> 00:17:07.218
Even though they lied...

00:17:09.598 --> 00:17:11.788
...I believed them.

00:17:12.668 --> 00:17:14.258
Those guys...

00:17:19.508 --> 00:17:21.628
You believed them, huh?

00:17:24.278 --> 00:17:25.468
Take this!

00:17:26.778 --> 00:17:27.768
You can have it!

00:17:29.518 --> 00:17:31.708
I can't handle guys
who get so passionate.

00:17:36.418 --> 00:17:37.478
H-Hey!

00:17:43.028 --> 00:17:46.968
Humans think the same way...

00:17:47.038 --> 00:17:49.468
...as they did 5,000 years ago.

00:18:16.398 --> 00:18:19.058
Yes, yes.
Just a little bit more.

00:18:29.478 --> 00:18:30.408
It's her!

00:18:38.288 --> 00:18:39.448
Those guys...

00:19:04.308 --> 00:19:06.368
Yes, Ovan.

00:19:07.478 --> 00:19:08.708
Good boy.

00:19:11.618 --> 00:19:14.648
The Key of the Twilight
does exist.

00:19:16.988 --> 00:19:18.688
He wasn't deceiving you.

00:19:24.998 --> 00:19:28.058
Why are you two guys
gazing at each other?

00:19:28.138 --> 00:19:28.998
Sakisaka?

00:19:29.638 --> 00:19:31.468
So, what happened?

00:19:32.568 --> 00:19:33.398
Look!

00:19:34.478 --> 00:19:35.338
Sakisaka!

00:19:43.148 --> 00:19:44.308
It's my teacher!

00:19:46.688 --> 00:19:49.118
Let's enter phase two.

00:19:52.228 --> 00:19:53.748
It looks like they gave up.

00:19:53.828 --> 00:19:54.918
I don't know about that.

00:20:01.938 --> 00:20:02.958
Welcome back.

00:20:03.738 --> 00:20:05.368
I'm not here to stay.

00:20:08.238 --> 00:20:10.068
Ovan, here!

00:20:10.248 --> 00:20:11.228
Teacher!

00:20:12.378 --> 00:20:14.368
Well done, Sakisaka.

00:20:14.778 --> 00:20:15.678
Good work.

00:20:16.348 --> 00:20:16.978
Thank you.

00:20:19.048 --> 00:20:20.778
Everyone's here now.

00:20:21.388 --> 00:20:22.188
Yeah.

00:20:25.688 --> 00:20:29.598
Even if I wake from my dreams

00:20:31.598 --> 00:20:35.698
I'll reach my hand out to you

00:20:42.378 --> 00:20:44.708
Haseo, the item.

00:20:45.148 --> 00:20:45.838
Okay.

00:20:48.718 --> 00:20:53.318
If our hearts can reach each other

00:20:53.318 --> 00:20:53.818
If our hearts can reach each other
I see.

00:20:53.818 --> 00:20:54.518
I see.

00:20:54.718 --> 00:20:59.348
with the same strength

00:21:00.558 --> 00:21:05.588
Then I would be able to bare

00:21:06.368 --> 00:21:11.298
The pain of many hearts

00:21:12.038 --> 00:21:15.768
I can feel that it will arrive soon

00:21:15.838 --> 00:21:20.678
When these walls will be torn down

00:21:21.278 --> 00:21:24.768
The dawn

00:21:27.358 --> 00:21:30.058
I threw myself on to the reset button,
thinking that was the goal

00:21:30.058 --> 00:21:31.158
I threw myself on to the reset button,
thinking that was the goal
Now!

00:21:31.158 --> 00:21:33.248
I threw myself on to the reset button,
thinking that was the goal

00:21:33.328 --> 00:21:39.268
We're going in circles in the same place

00:21:39.328 --> 00:21:45.968
If I go with the flow,
one day I'll break free from

00:21:46.038 --> 00:21:51.478
Yesterday's gravity with you.

00:21:51.478 --> 00:21:52.008
Yesterday's gravity with you.
Ovan you go ahead.

00:21:52.008 --> 00:21:53.138
Ovan you go ahead.

00:21:53.478 --> 00:21:54.538
I'll leave it to you.

00:21:58.218 --> 00:22:05.688
I will meet you

00:22:05.688 --> 00:22:09.558
I will meet you
We won't let you
get in Ovan's way.

00:22:09.558 --> 00:22:10.958
We won't let you
get in Ovan's way.

00:22:30.078 --> 00:22:33.678
Ikiru wa dokuhai kiyu no kurushimi wo
Life is a poisoned cup of needless suffering

00:22:33.758 --> 00:22:37.188
Nomihosu sube wo dare ga sazukeyo
That no one can show me how to drain

00:22:37.458 --> 00:22:40.858
Taiyo ni sumu toiu kenja no washi
A wise eagle is said to live in the sun

00:22:40.928 --> 00:22:45.298
Habataki dake ga kodama suru
The flapping of its wings
is all that echoes

00:22:48.798 --> 00:22:52.328
Kono futatsu no me ni yadotta
In each of these eyes

00:22:52.408 --> 00:22:56.038
Yami to Hikari sono docchi de
Dwell darkness and light

00:22:56.108 --> 00:23:03.408
Boku wa ashita wo mitsumeru beki nano darou
Through which shall I look to tomorrow?

00:23:03.478 --> 00:23:07.148
Kawaki kitta gareki no machi
A dried out and ruined city

00:23:07.218 --> 00:23:10.918
Ten to sen wo tsunagi awase
Draws the lines between the dots

00:23:10.988 --> 00:23:17.918
Imi nado nai koto bakari afurete iku
Causing meaningless events to overflow

00:23:18.098 --> 00:23:21.828
Honou no gotoki kodoku
Soothing the loneliness

00:23:21.898 --> 00:23:24.928
Idaku karada shizumete wa
That flames up within the body

00:23:25.008 --> 00:23:32.468
Ankyo eto shitatatte iku shizuku
Droplets of water fall towards the culvert

00:23:32.708 --> 00:23:35.908
Kakageru dokuhai kono sei wa michitemo
Even if the poisoned cup is upheld
and filled with this life

00:23:35.978 --> 00:23:40.008
Kogareru shino yume wa nagare tsuku
My dream that yearns for death
drifts into it

00:23:40.118 --> 00:23:43.718
Toride ni kuikomu tsume kokou no washi
The eagle remains aloof;
its talons dig into the fort

00:23:43.788 --> 00:23:47.348
Habataki dake ga maiagaru
Only the flapping of its wings resounds

00:23:47.428 --> 00:23:51.158
Ano soukyu ni takkei ni shite kure tamae
Let me be crucified in the blue sky

00:23:51.228 --> 00:23:54.928
Ten to chi ga musubu basho ni
bokuwa tatsu
I'll stand where heaven and earth meet

00:23:56.268 --> 00:23:59.238
Next Episode...
